CPU-side speed-ups backported from Waffle565/God-Of-War-Native-Port (runtime/switch branches, 2026-10-16..18) onto the
Tobiichi runtime: ecd6cb5 615b046 cba2dfc a4ff9ee 20634cd 7ffd30a abb0172 a92a453 d88bf4d 9d51673 (EE checkpoint fast
path, VIF1 UNPACK and VU1 worker overhead, native VU1 XGKICK/dispatch, pooled DMA buffers). Its GS draw-batching
commits (00bda7f 09ea6cb 91ac954 c558c21) are left out: on an AMD RX 580 they overloaded the GPU (window 0.2-2 Hz).
Measured on the Aegean ship (Xeon E5-2666 v3, RX 580, 2x): 42-45 -> 59-60 fps.

